<item><title>Egypt pays $38.2 billion in external debt service as reserves hit $57.5 billion</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-pays-38-2-billion-in-external-debt-service-as-7f1812/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-pays-38-2-billion-in-external-debt-service-as-7f1812/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The 2025/2026 bill was $500 million lower than the previous year, even as external debt rose to $166.7 billion by June.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:02:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-pays-38-2-billion-in-external-debt-service-as-7f1812/share.jpg" length="43285" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-pays-38-2-billion-in-external-debt-service-as-7f1812/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
