<item><title>Egypt and Syria sign aviation deal as direct flights remain out of service</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-and-syria-sign-aviation-deal-as-direct-flights-remain-96ecc4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-and-syria-sign-aviation-deal-as-direct-flights-remain-96ecc4/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The agreement allows technical exchanges and follows Egyptian inspections of Damascus and Aleppo airports after about 14 years without regular flights.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:28:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
